  "ruleText": "Env-A 4602.18 “CO2 allowances held” means the CO2 allowances recorded in accordance with Env-A 4607 and Env-A 4608 in a CO2 allowance tracking system account.\n\nSource. #9283, INTERIM, eff 10-1-08, EXPIRED: 3-30-09\n\nNew. #9444, eff 4-3-09; ss by #10468, eff 1-1-14; ss by #12967, eff 1-1-20 (from Env-A 4602.19)",
